# The assigned cell: mode=raid, boss=cold (The Long Cold), warrior:arms,
# dodge, 10-normal, fresh save, 390x844 touch.
# First dodge-style pull of The Long Cold at any difficulty, and the second
# style tried on this exact spec/size/difficulty combination -- the only
# prior appearance of warrior:arms on 10-normal Long Cold was flee
# (2026-09-26-15.play, killed in 86s, presses=0 inDanger=4%). dodge also
# never calls an ability but steers away from standing hazards rather than
# fleeing outright, so this checks whether that steering difference changes
# anything on a fight already shown to fall to a body that presses nothing.
open #b=cold&s=10&h=0
targets
tap class:warrior:arms
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
play dodge 150
state
bill
shot end
